#==============================================================================================
#
#   interpolation_5 - CSS interpolation: interpolate_value_impl's longer cases, repeatable
#                     lists, filter accumulation and interpolate_value
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/CSS/Interpolation.cpp (lines 1600-2028 in part, and
#       2030-2251), by region p4a: the cases of interpolate_value_impl that are functions here
#       (basic shapes, border-radius rectangles, font styles, radial sizes, superellipses and
#       value lists), the interpolation of repeatable lists (repeated to their least common
#       multiple length), the accumulation of filter value lists, and interpolate_value
#       (interpolate_value_impl, falling back to a discrete interpolation).
